notes:        Original work for this repository: the shapes of the Jilo Studio icon (assets/brand/jilo/jilo-studio.svg: the J and the editing track, without the plate) as a cover on a black panel, an editing-track arrow, no text. Layout and rules from the FilmCraft DMG background by @XusBadia. packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
